{"id":39047277,"q":"Q39047277","imdb":"tt6953076","en":"Sheikh Jackson","orig":"Sheikh Jackson","ar":"شيخ جاكسون","tag":null,"ov":"شيخ جاكسون فيلم دراما مصري من إنتاج عام 2017 من إخراج عمرو سلامة. تم عرض الفيلم في عروض خاصة القسم في مهرجان تورونتو السينمائي الدولي 2017. تم اختيار الفيلم للترشح لجائزة الأوسكار في نسختها ال90 لجائزة أفضل فيلم بلغة أجنبية عن جمهورية مصر العربية.","plotEn":"An Islamic cleric who likes to dress as Michael Jackson is thrown into a tailspin in the wake of the singer's death.","rd":"2017-09-11","rt":93,"g":[18,35],"lang":"ar","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"Rotana Media Group"},{"n":"Cleopatra Entertainment"}],"countries":["EG"],"langs":[],"col":null,"rel":[],"dir":["Amr Salama"],"prod":[],"wri":["Amr Salama"],"mus":["Hany Adel"],"dop":["Ahmed Beshary"],"cast":[{"n":"Ahmed El Fishawy","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Ahmed Malek","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Maged El Kedwany","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Dorra Zarrouk","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Basma Hassan","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Amina Khalil","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Yasmin Raeis","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Maged el-Kedwany","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Salma Abu Deif","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Ahmed Al-Fishawy","ch":"","p":null},{"n":"Mahmoud El Bezzawy","ch":"","p":null}],"wiki":{"en":"Sheikh Jackson","ar":"شيخ جاكسون"},"wk":1795620322388,"castOrder":["Ahmed El Fishawy","Ahmed Malek","Maged El Kedwany"]}